sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer / QA
    participant WebUI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Orchestrator as OrchestratorAgent
    participant Agents as Specialized Agents
    participant Sandbox as SandboxRunner
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    participant WS as WebSocket Clients

    User->>WebUI: Click "Start Analysis" (or ZIP Upload)
    WebUI->>API: POST /api/runs (project_id, provider, mode)
    API->>DB: Create Run Record (Status: pending)
    API-->>WebUI: Return Run Object (run_id)
    WebUI->>API: Establish WebSocket (/ws/runs/{run_id})
    API->>Orchestrator: execute_run(run_id, workspace_path)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Orchestrator, Agents: Pipeline Execution Stages
        Orchestrator->>DB: Check is_cancelled(run_id)
        Orchestrator->>Agents: 1. StaticAnalysisAgent.run()
        Agents-->>DB: Save file_risks, complexity metrics
        Orchestrator->>WS: Broadcast event: static_analysis_complete
        
        Orchestrator->>Agents: 2. TestGenerationAgent.run()
        Agents-->>Sandbox: Write generated pytest suites
        Orchestrator->>WS: Broadcast event: tests_generated

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 3. TestExecutionAgent.run()
        Agents->>Sandbox: Execute pytest & coverage in temp isolated workspace
        Sandbox-->>Agents: Test report (passed, failed, flaky, coverage)
        Agents-->>DB: Store test_results
        Orchestrator->>WS: Broadcast event: tests_executed

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 4. BugClassificationAgent.run()
        Agents-->>DB: Deduplicate and store bugs (MD5 signatures)

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 5. RootCauseAgent.run()
        Agents-->>DB: Update bug with root cause & AST code slice

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 6. AutoFixAgent.run()
        Agents->>Sandbox: Test proposed patch in temp sandbox (Pre-flight verify)
        Sandbox-->>Agents: Patch passes regression tests
        Agents-->>DB: Save patch diff & mark verified=True

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 7. CriticAgent.run()
        Agents-->>DB: Record agent debate messages & consensus score

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 8. MutationEngine.run()
        Agents->>Sandbox: Run mutated AST tests & compute mutation score
        Agents-->>DB: Save mutation_records

        Orchestrator->>Agents: 9. ReportAgent.run()
        Agents-->>DB: Save executive summary & technical report (Markdown)
        Orchestrator->>DB: Update Run (Status: completed)
        Orchestrator->>WS: Broadcast event: run_completed
    end

    WebUI->>User: Display KPIs, Graphs, Bug Explorer, and Download Report
